1. [LOCAL] Define list of universities to compare. | out university_list
2. [READ] For each university in $university_list, search for student rentals. | out rental_search_results | api Student Housing / Search | args { "universities": $university_list }
3. [READ] For each university in $university_list, calculate the drive time from home. | out drive_time | api Driving Directions / Calculate | args { "origin": "home_address", "destinations": $university_list }
4. [READ] For each university in $university_list, fetch weather information. | out weather_info | api Weather Data / Get | args { "locations": $university_list }
5. [READ] For each university in $university_list, search for recent news. | out news_search_results | api News Articles / Search | args { "keywords": $university_list }
6. [PROCESS] Rank universities based on rental prices, drive times, weather conditions, and news relevance. | out ranking | api University Ranking / Compute | args { "rentals": $rental_search_results, "drives": $drive_time, "weather": $weather_info, "news": $news_search_results }
7. [LOCAL] Create a PDF document with the ranked universities. | out pdf_document | api Document Creation / PDF | args { "content": $ranking }
8. [WRITE] Send the PDF document to the user and their parents via email. | out email_status | api MailRecipe / Send Email | args { "to": ["user.email", "parents.email"], "subject": "University Comparison Report", "body": "Please find attached the ranked universities.", "attachments": ["$step7.pdf_document"] }

1. [READ] Scan and process the scanned rulebook to extract text. | out rulebook_text
